        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Davis, Diana Douglas, Moses Gunn, A Martinez, Robert Carradine, Clay O'Brien\n- TV series: The Cowboys, Dallas\n- Roles: Jock Ewing\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Davis was born on August 26, 1909, and died on April 26, 1981.\n- Jim Davis was an American actor.\n- The television show \"The Cowboys\" starred Jim Davis, Diana Douglas, Moses Gunn, A Martinez, Robert Carradine, and Clay O'Brien.\n- Jim Davis was best known for playing Jock Ewing in the CBS prime-time soap opera \"Dallas.\"\n- Jim Davis continued in the role of Jock Ewing until a terminal illness made him too ill to perform.",
